@startuml code-generation
!include style.iuml

start
:Change a FastEndpoints request,
response or summary;
:just gen exports the contract
to frontend/openapi.json;
:Orval reads the contract;
fork
  :api/generated
  TanStack Query hooks and models;
fork again
  :MSW handlers
  for stories and tests;
fork again
  :api/schemas
  zod schemas;
end fork
:Commit contract and generated code
with the backend and frontend change;
stop
@enduml
